 (WARNING  130) $CONTR DATA= APPEARS IN OLDER VERSIONS BUT IS DEPRECATED.
 USE $CONTR OBSDATA=
             
 (WARNING  2) NM-TRAN INFERS THAT THE DATA ARE POPULATION.
  
